{"id":"3ceadded579f13a7","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-thm-density-existence.md","title":"Existence of Dense Sets","display":"thm-density-existence — Existence of Dense Sets","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-density-existence","aliases":["58-thm-density-existence"],"display":"thm-density-existence — Existence of Dense Sets","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-density-existence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-density-existence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-density-existence — Existence of Dense Sets"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" href=\"?note=cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\">\\(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S\\)</span> are the imported typed predicates</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|\">\\(|\\cdot|\\)</span> is the imported cardinality operator</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}density\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\to\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land|D|\\leq|\\mathbb P|\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}density\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\to\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land|D|\\leq|\\mathbb P|\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Taking <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D=\\mathbb P\">\\(D=\\mathbb P\\)</span> proves the sharp universal bound <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|D|\\leq|\\mathbb P|\">\\(|D|\\leq|\\mathbb P|\\)</span>.\nThe former “at most continuum” remark did not follow when <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb P\">\\(\\mathbb P\\)</span> was\nlarger than the continuum.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-dense-subset-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"2be08d4ee8aa1590","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"|\\cdot|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}density\\text{-}existence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Poset}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\to\\exists D\\subseteq\\mathbb P\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DenseSubsetPoset}_S(D,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\land|D|\\leq|\\mathbb P|\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"D=\\mathbb P","display":false},{"tex":"|D|\\leq|\\mathbb P|","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb P","display":false}],"bytes":1040,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4112","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-thm-density-existence.md|58-thm-density-existence]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018","cc7ca8f5bdd5c9bc","2be08d4ee8aa1590"]}